      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{667660bc733c9df5fbc6043b|full_name} Wanting this for my world projects, not avatars.\n\nAlso, various objects on avatars are standard mesh renderers. VRChat's new avatar accessories are also primarily toon standard, and many of them are standard mesh renderers.\n\nI ended up creating a custom copy of VRChat toon standard that had GPU instancing for my project, this is a feature request for more accessibility of that for others",
